# The Alliance rank 11 PvP mounts from Lieutenant Karter in Stormwind.
# Rank 11 (Commander / Lieutenant General) unlocks the Black War mounts;
# vendors in Stormwind and Orgrimmar.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level 40,
# 100g, racial riding spell, no rank in the item itself). Our data has no spawn
# for the vendor, so the waypoint is the honor hall next to its quartermasters
# (npcs.json).

step PvP rank 11
  tip Forever's PvP ranks come from Rank Points earned in battlegrounds and world PvP, with a weekly cap; Commander (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 40 and the riding skill.
  level 40
  skill Riding 75

step Lieutenant Karter
  tip Lieutenant Karter sells the mounts in the Champions' Hall in Stormwind's Old Town, beside the other honor quartermasters such as Officer Areyn. The Forever client lists each at 100g; choose one.
  vendor 12783 @73.8,53.6             -- Lieutenant Karter
  buy 18241 npc 12783 @73.8,53.6 optional -- 100g
  buy 18242 npc 12783 @73.8,53.6 optional -- 100g
  buy 18243 npc 12783 @73.8,53.6 optional -- 100g
  buy 18244 npc 12783 @73.8,53.6 optional -- 100g
